The [[Holy Spear]] is a [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Spear]] with a [[Glowing Crown]]. It deals moderate damage and costs very little stamina. Like all [[Spear]]s, the [[Holy Spear]] breaks extra {{icon/block}} on hit proportional to the {{icon/star}} spaces that meet the requirements. In this case, the [[Holy Spear]] destroys lots of {{icon/block}}, second only to the [[Very Long Spear]], and cleanses a debuff, per {{icon/star}} left empty or containing a {{icon/holy}}-item. The {{icon/star}}s are arranged in a cross-pattern that's often easier to accommodate than the typical [[Spear]] pattern. The [[Holy Spear]] also boasts an improved [[Glowing Crown]] invincibility ability that costs the same 10 {{icon/mana}}, but lasts longer, and additionally doubles the speed of the [[Holy Spear]]. The [[Holy Spear]] also has an unusual 200% accuracy, which makes it all-but immune to the effects of {{icon/blind}}.
